+
+Request: customers are overcharged shipping on orders of exactly 50.00 € of items, or reaching 50.00 € only through
+quantities (3 × 17.00 €). The rule is 50.00 € of items or more, quantities included.
+
+Finding: `shippingFor` in `src/domain/shipping.ts` already multiplies by quantity and uses `>=` against 5000 cents
+(fixed in 1.5.0, per CHANGELOG). The repository does not reproduce the bug, so customers are likely still on a
+build older than 1.5.0. No source change was needed; added a regression test for 3 × 17.00 € (free) and 49.99 €
+(charged). No new release is made here: a release needs the approver's approval first (p1); 1.5.0 already
+carries the fix, so deploying it is what reaches customers.
